1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,410
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Amy needed to stay awake for 24 hours.

2
00:00:04,390 --> 00:00:05,910
It was easy at first.

3
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:08,370
She did what she usually does.

4
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:10,070
She went to school.

5
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:12,330
She went to piano practice.

6
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:14,570
She did her homework.

7
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:16,610
She did her chores.

8
00:00:17,530 --> 00:00:19,410
She spent time with friends.

9
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:22,490
It started getting hard at midnight.

10
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:24,750
Her parents were sleeping.

11
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:27,250
Her friends were sleeping too.

12
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:29,890
She didn't know what to do.

13
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:32,250
She turned on the TV.

14
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:34,570
There was nothing interesting.

15
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:37,810
She read more of her textbook.

16
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:40,450
That was making her more sleepy.

17
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:42,930
Amy was getting desperate.

18
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:44,990
She went to the kitchen.

19
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:47,330
She made herself coffee.

20
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:49,670
She drank three cups.

21
00:00:50,410 --> 00:00:52,250
She was now wide awake.
